# Frontend image build context is the product root; this file is picked up
# as .dockerignore when building with the root context. The frontend-only
# entries that matter for dockerignore are the same as the root's:
#
#   frontend/node_modules/
#   frontend/dist/
#   frontend/.env
#
# The root .dockerignore already excludes these. A per-directory
# .dockerignore (this file) only takes effect when the build context is
# frontend/ itself:
node_modules/
dist/
.env
.git
*.log
